<title>PORTUGAL: BPSM resumes trade at 1,200 escudos.</title>
<headline>BPSM resumes trade at 1,200 escudos.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Portuguese bank Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor, which was interrupted temporarily on the Lisbon bourse today, resumed at 1,200 escudos, the bourse said.</p>
<p>The trade was interrupted after BPSM hit a 1997 high of 1,298 escudos.</p>
